#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:5
#: 3290836749044498b6913d0671d5041c
msgid "Generalities"
msgstr "Splošnosti"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:8
#: aedd59659a714fa2abb49207683c967b
msgid "Rights"
msgstr "Pravice"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:10
#: 6708c81adba34f4a9793539f8c702659
msgid "We can see several rights level in Galette, allowing access to different parts and features of the application. Levels are:"
msgstr ""
"V Galette lahko vidimo več ravni pravic, ki omogočajo dostop do različnih "
"delov in funkcij aplikacije. Ravni so:"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:12
#: f45faab5ace5443b8ce85c2ff723ea64
msgid "**super administrator** is a special user (the only one that is not a member) created at installation,"
msgstr ""
"**super administrator** je poseben uporabnik (edini, ki ni član), ustvarjen "
"ob namestitvi,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:13
#: 8a28b1fcecf24f8caae2f15faa83eb3f
msgid "**administrators** are members for who the \"administrator\" checkbox has been checked,"
msgstr ""
"**administratorji** so člani, pri katerih je bilo označeno polje »"
"administrator«,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:14
#: 9379504d759848ef82d1a66c1380de93
msgid "**staff members** have a specific status (President, Treasurer, Secretary, ...),"
msgstr ""
"**zaposleni** imajo poseben status (predsednik, blagajnik, tajnik, ...),"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:15
#: bb0426100a0b459ab61a251e5929881c
msgid "**groups managers** have only rights on the groups they manage,"
msgstr ""
"**Upravitelji skupin** imajo pravice samo v skupinah, ki jih upravljajo,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:16
#: 6debbf52d0d1432fa6278b6fe46c8831
msgid "**up to date members** are members whose account are active, and whose subscription are up to date,"
msgstr ""
"**aktualni člani** so člani, katerih računi so aktivni in katerih naročnine "
"so posodobljene,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:17
#: 3197153fe4ed4de2a2ba7dad34e34e24
msgid "**members** are members whose account is inactive or whose subscriptions are not up to date,"
msgstr ""
"**člani** so člani, katerih račun je neaktiven ali katerih naročnine niso "
"posodobljene,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:18
#: 4752ce2332eb48b3816974f1ea68e173
msgid "simple **visitors**."
msgstr "preprosti **obiskovalci**."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:20
#: 7b525eb37f7946e19f44b72b5a397693
msgid "Staff members, administrators as well as the super administrator can create, edit and remove members, contributions, transactions, send emailings, ..."
msgstr ""
"Člani osebja, administratorji in super administrator lahko ustvarjajo, "
"urejajo in odstranjujejo člane, prispevke, transakcije, pošiljajo e-pošto ..."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:22
#: 5239d1e5fd354f5baae45e9bae2b1431
msgid "Administrators have also access to the application configuration, excepted super admin information."
msgstr ""
"Skrbniki imajo tudi dostop do konfiguracije aplikacije, razen do podatkov "
"super administratorja."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:24
#: 1fd726c4806f4fc993b9ff4d96aabf0b
msgid "The super administrator has a full access to the application, but not to all features. Indeed, this is not a member account, and it cannot have some of required information. He of course can change its own login information from application preferences."
msgstr ""
"Super administrator ima poln dostop do aplikacije, vendar ne do vseh "
"funkcij. Dejansko to ni članski račun in ne more imeti nekaterih zahtevanih "
"podatkov. Seveda lahko v nastavitvah aplikacije spremeni lastne podatke za "
"prijavo."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:26
#: dbf78a8061f948d1b9a53876a97d8668
msgid "Members can change their own information, and can see their contributions and transactions (as read only)."
msgstr ""
"Člani lahko spreminjajo svoje podatke in si lahko ogledajo svoje prispevke "
"in transakcije (samo za branje)."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:28
#: 2ec81764c7c74d6d910387191e22e424
msgid "Visitors can - if this is parameted in preferences - access to public pages (trombinoscope, public members list) but can also register :)"
msgstr ""
"Obiskovalci lahko - če je to nastavljeno v nastavitvah - dostopajo do javnih "
"strani (trombinoskop, javni seznam članov), lahko pa se tudi registrirajo :)"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:31
#: 5e9b415b446849309aa7d5a3744202d5
msgid "Group managers"
msgstr "Vodje skupin"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:33
#: c52593e32c54402cb6aaa881a87a0265
msgid "With the stricter configuration, groups managers can show and search on members of their groups, and see accessible data for members. On members and cards, you can :ref:`configure which fields are accessible <fields_acls>`."
msgstr ""
"S strožjo konfiguracijo lahko upravitelji skupin prikazujejo in iščejo člane "
"svojih skupin ter vidijo dostopne podatke za člane. Pri članih in karticah "
"lahko :ref:`konfigurirate, katera polja so dostopna <fields_acls>`."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:36
#: d53a9286fb544215a6b7bbf04f552cfe
msgid "From the preferences, you can also :ref:`give groups managers extra rights <pref_rights>`, like editing or creating members."
msgstr ""
"V nastavitvah lahko :ref:`upraviteljem skupin podelite tudi dodatne pravice "
"<pref_rights>`, kot je urejanje ali ustvarjanje članov."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:39
#: 31aaecc6f4e0419ea7a417377a069073
msgid "Management rules"
msgstr "Pravila upravljanja"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:41
#: 51888802629d4065818d754674be9907
msgid "Due dates are calculated by day. If a member pay into before the end of his membership, duration of this membership will be added to remaining days. Example:"
msgstr ""
"Roki se izračunajo po dnevih. Če član plača pred koncem članstva, se "
"trajanje tega članstva prišteje k preostalim dnevom. Primer:"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:0
#: 214f6f82e91b4741a43d640ce5643e01
#: 214f6f82e91b4741a43d640ce5643e01
msgid "Roger subscribed on 2004-01-01 for one year,"
msgstr "Roger se je 1. 1. 2004 naročil za eno leto,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:0
#: 9e6117abdeee456d8852fd075294872a
msgid "if he pays into for a year on 2004-12-13,"
msgstr "če plača za eno leto 13. 12. 2004,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:0
#: ae5968aad1b54262bb5da72f655b8cdb
msgid "his due date will become 2006-01-01."
msgstr "njegov rok bo 1. 1. 2006."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:0
#: ff90ff7a1bf04281b3e0cd8488c5c5e7
msgid "No day will be forget."
msgstr "Noben dan ne bo pozabljen."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:48
#: 538b498de81c48169c8266a4b8088d8f
msgid "At the contrary, if a member renew his membership late, we evaluate again his membership duration:"
msgstr ""
"V nasprotnem primeru, če član podaljša članstvo pozno, ponovno ocenimo "
"trajanje njegovega članstva:"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:0
#: 8494c52c01aa459f8c3bd8c6ecdb6b69
msgid "if he pays into for a year on 2006-01-13,"
msgstr "če plača za eno leto dne 13. 1. 2006,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:0
#: 507e4e3cdeed49e6aa50811c645dd6c8
msgid "his due date will become 2006-01-13."
msgstr "njegov rok bo 13. 1. 2006."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:54
#: f9f9774839f946bda567d24f7ea3c519
msgid "He is not an up to date member from 2006-01-01 to 2006-01-13... On paper at least :)"
msgstr ""
"Ni bil posodobljen član od 1. 1. 2006 do 13. 1. 2006 ... Vsaj na papirju :)"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:56
#: a9f52a0386e5464094865003ca2a6885
msgid "Those rules are flexible because you can freely change membership dates on contributions, if you have rights to add or update them. We can imagine an association who stores all contributions on the first day of the next month (offering its members a longer membership time)."
msgstr ""
"Ta pravila so prilagodljiva, saj lahko prosto spreminjate datume članstva "
"pri prispevkih, če imate pravice do njihovega dodajanja ali posodabljanja. "
"Lahko si predstavljamo združenje, ki shrani vse prispevke prvi dan "
"naslednjega meseca (in svojim članom ponudi daljši čas članstva)."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:59
#: ad993e18a4fc4a319eb9f88ffa3471de
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Vmesnik"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:61
#: b1e93fcab7a14b56a840c17cd2b3bcb8
msgid "We do our best for the Galette interface to be:"
msgstr "Trudimo se, da bi bil vmesnik Galette:"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:63
#: c968d38cb1cb41e19016dd44941f5e5d
msgid "logical and consistent (you will always find icons at familiar places),"
msgstr "logično in dosledno (ikone boste vedno našli na znanih mestih),"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:64
#: fd066041c1a743398b519306e3a5d05c
msgid "web standards compliant (HTML and CSS valid),"
msgstr "skladnost s spletnimi standardi (veljavnost HTML in CSS),"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:65
#: b075df05b0d143268e0633fa3b06ca7c
msgid "HTML semantic respectful,"
msgstr "HTML semantično spoštljiv,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:66
#: 7c1400bf5e5b434d9e2b6481a8ab595d
msgid "accessible (without any WCAG, WAI or equivalent tests run)."
msgstr "dostopno (brez izvajanja testov WCAG, WAI ali enakovrednih testov)."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:68
#: 2960232bd4724e93ad632e80178241b9
msgid "If you find places where one of those points is incorrect, do not hesitate to tell us on the tracker or on the mailing list!"
msgstr ""
"Če najdete mesta, kjer je katera od teh točk napačna, nam to brez oklevanja "
"sporočite na sledilniku ali na poštnem seznamu!"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:71
#: 1aabbce7b0cb4927859d20f860b43f21
msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr "Telemetrija"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:75
#: f8982c56edcc471d98c033a528d4380d
msgid "Galette propose to send some telemetry information:"
msgstr "Galette predlaga pošiljanje nekaterih telemetričnih podatkov:"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:77
#: 4519b628e22942a88201b31cd43b64fc
msgid "**entirely anonymous**: no information about your association or your members is sent,"
msgstr ""
"**popolnoma anonimno**: ne pošiljajo se nobeni podatki o vašem združenju ali "
"vaših članih,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:78
#: 2c6bf23858da4b0e90c97d92919c91e3
msgid "**deliberately blurred**: we retrieve an estimation of members count, never a real count,"
msgstr ""
"**namerno zamegljeno**: pridobimo oceno števila članov, nikoli dejanskega "
"števila,"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:79
#: afb1e1c17cfe4a8994b616525e1c366b
msgid "sent by a **secured** way (`HTTPS`) on https://telemetry.galette.eu."
msgstr ""
"poslano po **zaščitenem** načinu (`HTTPS`) na https://telemetry.galette.eu."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:81
#: 04caf4fc0f8f4a4ab7ce62daf38cae70
msgid "Sending telemetry data is a manual process, nothing will be send until you **explicitely** ask it. With those information, we can have a better knwownledge of different usages of Galette, their number of member or contributions, plugins used, ..."
msgstr ""
"Pošiljanje telemetričnih podatkov je ročni postopek, nič ne bo poslano, "
"dokler tega **izrecno** ne zahtevate. S temi informacijami lahko bolje "
"razumemo različne uporabe Galette, število članov ali prispevkov, "
"uporabljene vtičnike ..."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:83
#: 1f5a8ae07d244e35aabe0dfd5cabbf7e
msgid "Those information are useful for the project development and promotion. When you send those information, you can review data that would be sent."
msgstr ""
"Te informacije so koristne za razvoj in promocijo projekta. Ko pošljete te "
"informacije, lahko pregledate podatke, ki bi bili poslani."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:85
#: ee5a415f2b7e46e0aed869a4fcdb46b1
msgid "Preview Telemetry data"
msgstr "Predogled telemetričnih podatkov"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:90
#: 30105a34799740a78fc7762d9bbc7cdd
msgid "After data has been sent once, Galette will propose to send an update from time to time. You can also send them from Galette preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ko so podatki enkrat poslani, bo Galette občasno predlagal pošiljanje "
"posodobitev. Pošljete jih lahko tudi v nastavitvah Galette."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:92
#: 66fb93f25b53476f9902dfff177aeeab
msgid "Telemetry update reminder"
msgstr "Opomnik za posodobitev telemetrije"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:96
#: 1c58525d6fd24363ae4bf07399858e13
msgid "It is also possible to register your association on the website, of course, not anonymously, but it is not possible to link telemetry and registration. New references are moderated."
msgstr ""
"Na spletni strani je mogoče tudi registrirati svoje društvo, seveda ne "
"anonimno, vendar ni mogoče povezati telemetrije in registracije. Nove "
"reference so moderirane."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:98
#: f049660c866e4657a9d7b4e6112d7cda
msgid "You can update your registration information from Galette preferences. The form will be blank (because it is not possible to retrieve data you've sent) but all data will be updated because your instance has a unique registration identifier designed for that."
msgstr ""
"Podatke o registraciji lahko posodobite v nastavitvah Galette. Obrazec bo "
"prazen (ker ni mogoče pridobiti podatkov, ki ste jih poslali), vendar bodo "
"vsi podatki posodobljeni, ker ima vaš primerek edinstven identifikator "
"registracije, zasnovan za to."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:100
#: e2a91bd507aa4493bface5b20065bf23
msgid "Telemetry from preferences"
msgstr "Telemetrija iz nastavitev"

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:104
#: a7af866a2baf4935b0c066c962e8c8e3
msgid "A new panel has been added on Galette dashboard to send telemetry information and/or register your instance. Once those steps has been completed, the panel will dissapear. You also can choose to just disable it."
msgstr ""
"Na nadzorni plošči Galette je bila dodana nova plošča za pošiljanje "
"telemetričnih podatkov in/ali registracijo vašega primerka. Ko so ti koraki "
"zaključeni, bo plošča izginila. Lahko pa jo tudi preprosto onemogočite."

#: ../usermanual/generalites.rst:106
#: 5ffec6b32f8348af8bdd04f122a3dc16
msgid "Telemetry on dashboard"
msgstr "Telemetrija na nadzorni plošči"
